    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a free fan work of <i>Metal Max</i>. The project was initiated in 2010 as a War3 RPG map, undergoing three complete overhauls during development. Constrained by the technical limitations of the War3 engine, the team had to migrate to a new engine and is now completely reconstructing it on Unreal Engine 4. The game features traditional turn-based combat, random encounters (both visible and invisible), and a dual-system for close-quarters battles and tank warfare.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848180/extras/c38e111b4b26e3eecb3b84777534540b.avif?t=1751686480\" width=640 height=348 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848180/extras/7a88ab3fe40ab3fc3137f57e7675df2b.avif?t=1751686480\" width=640 height=288 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a free fan work of <i>Metal Max</i>. The project was initiated in 2010 as a War3 RPG map, undergoing three complete overhauls during development. Constrained by the technical limitations of the War3 engine, the team had to migrate to a new engine and is now completely reconstructing it on Unreal Engine 4. The game features traditional turn-based combat, random encounters (both visible and invisible), and a dual-system for close-quarters battles and tank warfare.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848180/extras/c38e111b4b26e3eecb3b84777534540b.avif?t=1751686480\" width=640 height=348 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848180/extras/7a88ab3fe40ab3fc3137f57e7675df2b.avif?t=1751686480\" width=640 height=288 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "This is a free Metal Max fan work. Set 50 years after the first game, the story takes place as the wasteland recovers from the &quot;Great Destruction&quot;. A mysterious group is secretly carrying out a terrible plan: capturing humans to turn them into cyborgs, aiming to rule the entire wasteland.",
